OverTheWire Bandit: Level 9 → 10

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 10.
The password is stored in the file data.txt among human-readable strings, preceded by several = characters.

Steps
Log in as bandit9:
ssh bandit9@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Extract readable strings and filter the password:
strings data.txt | grep "="

Result
The output reveals the password for Bandit Level 10.
